    },
    {
      "id": "155:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36747:36749"
    },
    {
      "id": "155:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "夜色越来越深。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36749:36758"
    },
    {
      "id": "155:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你在松树的阴影中跟着陌生人。森林的地面在你脚下噼啪作响。但他还没有注意到你。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36758:36798"
    },
    {
      "id": "155:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "他带着你从黑山峰的一侧下去，进到一条狭窄的山谷。山谷中地面平坦，四周山脊环绕，都生着茂密的松树。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36798:36848"
    },
    {
      "id": "155:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "太阳开始没入地平线。阴影开始拉长。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36848:36867"
    },
    {
      "id": "155:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要继续跟踪，转到 164。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36867:36882"
    },
    {
      "id": "155:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要返回小屋，转到 156。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36882:36897"
    }
  ]
}
